# TPSS on the lithium atom -- the open-shell meta-GGA deck.
#
# scf_he_tpss already covers the non-multiplicative kinetic-energy-density term.
# What this deck adds is spin polarization with *unequal* spin densities, which
# is a different code path in three places:
#
#   * XCfunctional::make_libxc_args takes its spin-polarized branch, where the
#     reduced density gradient is a 3-vector (sigma_aa, sigma_ab, sigma_bb)
#     rather than a scalar,
#   * XCOperator::make_xc_potential unpacks eight intermediates instead of five
#     and adds the cross-spin flux term, and
#   * XCOperator::set_tau builds a separate tau for each channel.
#
# A spin-compensated system run with `spin_restricted false` exercises none of
# that in anger: with rho_alpha == rho_beta the cross terms are degenerate with
# the diagonal ones. Li is the cheapest system where they are not -- alpha is
# 1s+2s, beta is 1s alone.
#
# The regression this guards against: sigma used to be assembled from separately
# represented chi = |grad ln rho|^2 functions, so the sigma matrix handed to
# libxc was not the Gram matrix of the density gradients. Near the nuclear cusp
# the projection error in chi is O(1) -- large enough to make a sum of squares
# negative, which put sigma_aa and sigma_bb on their positivity floor while
# sigma_ab kept its full value, and sent the total sigma negative -- which is
# |grad rho|^2 and cannot be. The correlation kernels return NaN for vsigma once
# that happens, so this deck aborted in iteration 0.
#
# Reference: TURBOMOLE UKS/aug-cc-pV5Z gives -7.48878242939 for the same
# functional. This deck's single 1e-4 rung lands 135 uHa below that, and tightening
# to a [1e-4, 1e-6] ladder takes it to -7.489068, 286 uHa below -- the expected
# sign and magnitude of a meta-GGA basis-set increment (the closed-shell
# counterpart scf_he_tpss shows the same behaviour). Only one Gaussian basis was
# available for Li, so there is no increment to extrapolate against; the deck is
# a code-path test, not a converged calculation.
#
# Run:   ./run.sh          (or: madqc --wf=scf scf_li_tpss.in)

dft
    xc       tpss
    nopen    1
    protocol [1e-4]
    maxiter  20
    econv    1e-4
    dconv    1e-3
end

molecule
    units   atomic
    eprec   1e-6
    Li  0.0  0.0  0.0
end
